+sub_section( 'Boxed site container', 'boxed' )

	+mark( 'nav', 'Appearance', 'Customize', 'Theme Options', 'Colors & Background', '"Site container"' ).is-path-featured

	p The theme can be set to either <strong>boxed</strong> or <strong>fullwidth</strong> layout. Default layout is <strong>boxed</strong>, meaning it creates a space surrounding the site container on large screens (wider than 1600px).

	p Boxed/fullwidth layout can be toggled by setting up the "<strong>Site container</strong>" color in theme options. If you leave (set) the color value empty, site container will stretch the full width of the browser window, removing the boxed margin.

	+image( 'boxed.jpg', 'Setting empty value for site container background color' )
